1118 0 obj
  << /ActualText (If the nozzle is partially clogged\054 use an H2\0565 hex key to remove the two fixing screws and remove the composite hotend assembly\056 Then\054 use a slender hex key or a similar tool to force through the nozzle to clear the blockage\056 Once filament can exit the nozzle\054 reassemble the hotend and extrude several times to flush out remaining debris\056 If the clog cannot be cleared\054 replace the composite hotend assembly with a new one\056)
     /K [ 17 ]
     /P 1119 0 R
     /Pg 1084 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
